7
00:00:35,638 --> 00:00:39,178
- Oh, Mrs. Cooper, it smells so good.
- You take notes, darling.

8
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:43,350
The real way to get a man is with meIted
cheese and cream of mushroom soup.

9
00:00:43,521 --> 00:00:47,191
